# ---- secrets: never, under any circumstance -------------------------------
.Renviron
.env
*.key
*_key.txt
secrets*

# ---- large pre-generated artifacts (A1-A6) --------------------------------
# These live on MetaCentrum storage, not in git. data/big/README.md tells
# participants how to fetch them.
data/big/**
!data/big/README.md

# ---- R / Python noise ------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.rds.tmp

# ---- Stan build products ---------------------------------------------------
# A compiled model is a few MB and only runs on the machine that built it.
# The shared cluster copy lives in the artifacts directory instead.
*.exe
*.o
*.hpp
09_model/model

# ---- things each participant generates for themselves -----------------------
results/
logs/
my_reviews.csv
my_embeddings.rds
Rplots.pdf
